and the royal family.

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:19.319
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:25.191
Millions of Americans
are currently in crisis

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.594
thanks to the pandemic
and economic crash

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.862
with poverty and food scarcity
on the rise

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:31.563
