00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:52.786 line:0%
and we got to have
an investigation.

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:55.755
-Forget that. I can't imagine
Trump having a dog, period.

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:58.958
Like, if I close my eyes,
my brain won't do it.

